@host = http://localhost:5270

### Is the API alive?
GET {{host}}/health

### The league table
GET {{host}}/standings

### League fixtures (everyone plays everyone)
GET {{host}}/matches/league

### Knockout fixtures (seeded, round one only)
GET {{host}}/matches/knockout

### An unknown format - should come back 400, not 404
GET {{host}}/matches/banana
